   'Squash Blossom Necklace – Navajo Style Western Statement Necklace', 'A bold Western classic designed to stand out. This handcrafted squash blossom necklace features vibrant turquoise stones set along traditional Navajo-style beads and finished with a large crescent naja pendant. The striking silhouette instantly elevates denim, dresses, or layered cowgirl looks — a true statement piece for Western lovers. Each stone carries natural variation, giving every necklace its own character and authentic Southwestern charm. Perfect for rodeo outfits, country concerts, and everyday Western styling.', 'statement-pieces',
