   'Navajo Pearl Necklace Gorgeous Southwest Colors w Naja Pendant', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! This beautiful Navajo Pearl necklace is made from 4 and 8mm beads. Coral Acai Beads are 5mm. Beautiful Turquoise is 5mm. Pendant is cast in luxurious White Bronze This adjustable design is strung on high-quality leather The silver slider bead allows for fully custom sizing- fits any neck size! Genuine leather is about 36” long. DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John NECKLACE CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, Navajo handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
