   'Copper Navajo Style Pearl Necklace and Earrings Set - Triple Strand Bead Necklace -Western Cowgirl Layered Necklace- Southwestern Jewelry', 'Navajo Style Pearl Necklace, Triple Strand Copper Bead Necklace, Western Cowgirl Layered Necklace, Southwestern Statement Jewelry 8 mm Beads - Polished Burnished Copper Elevate your Western style with this bold copper Navajo style bead jewelry set featuring a statement necklace and matching earrings crafted with burnished copper beads. The warm, rustic finish and classic Southwestern design make this set a standout piece for cowgirls who love authentic Western jewelry with eye‑catching shine. Each bead is shaped in the traditional Navajo style, giving the necklace and earrings a handcrafted, heritage‑inspired look that pairs beautifully with denim, fringe jackets, boots, and boho outfits. Necklace : 32" Long with a 5" extension with 3 strands Earrings: 1" Long Production partners AdalynCourtMarket makes this item with help from Wholesale Jewelry Shop, Dallas, TX', 'statement-pieces',
