  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'desert-bloom-navajo-pearl-styler-and-pink-conch-shell-necklace-handmade-southwes', '4531174348', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4531174348/desert-bloom-navajo-pearl-styler-and?click_key=EuX5FzdRggwFsk_OCl1UFY9nASa9%3ALT0c72224530599e9cc5a16a6b61f717d8d9d3e08b&click_sum=9a47e502&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1072116-18-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sca=1&sts=1',
   'Desert Bloom Navajo Pearl Styler and Pink Conch Shell Necklace | Handmade Southwestern Statement Jewelry', 'A delicate yet timeless piece crafted with 4, 5 & 6 mm oxidized sterling silver Navajo Pearl–style beads accented by natural turquoise. It is lightweight, minimal design makes it perfect for everyday wear, stacking, or adding a subtle Southwestern touch to your look. Details • 4,5,6 mm oxidized sterling silver Navajo Pearl beads • Natural pink conch shell accent beads for a soft pop of color • Lightweight, smooth, and comfortable for daily wear • Available as a bracelet or anklet • Strung on durable, high‑quality materials for long‑lasting shine', 'statement-pieces',
