   'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver Men’s Ring with Natural Turquoise – Size 11.5 Southwestern Native American Jewelry', 'Beautiful vintage Navajo men’s ring crafted in sterling silver, featuring a natural turquoise stone. This eye-catching Southwestern piece showcases traditional Native American craftsmanship and timeless vintage character. A unique addition to any vintage jewelry collection or a perfect statement accessory for everyday wear. Item Details: * Style: Vintage Navajo * Jewelry Type: Men’s Ring * Material: Sterling Silver * Stone: Natural Turquoise * Ring Size: 11.5 * Weight: 22.2 grams * Setting Measurements: 1.0 x 1.1 inches DISCLOSURE: ALL ITEMS SOLD AS IS AS PICTURED. ITEMS MAY HAVE SCRATCHES OR DENTS SINCE THEY ARE USED VINTAGE ITEMS SOLD AS IS.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
