  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'e-begay-navajo-ring-in-sterling-silver-with-turquoise-size-7-tested-sterling-vin', '4588018617', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4588018617/e-begay-navajo-ring-in-sterling-silver?click_key=EugkcJZevM2EO6fM0v0nl1VJ0U96%3ALTbad22d9906e16dc6fecfb0b0099145ac026980eb&click_sum=eee53ffe&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-784233-11-4&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1',
   'E Begay Navajo Ring in Sterling Silver with Turquoise,Size 7. Tested Sterling, Vintage Estate Jewelry.', 'E Begay Navajo Ring in Sterling Silver with Turquoise,Size 7. Tested Sterling, Vintage Estate Jewelry. Height is .79". Erick Begay is an award-winning Navajo master silversmith and goldsmith who creates handmade Native American jewelry through his shop N8tiveArts in Boulder City, Nevada. Spend $35 in my shop and shipping is free. I specialize in Sterling Silver jewelry, my items are all estate jewelry. Most items are antiques from Victorian to the 1980''s. Occasionally items are more recent and those are noted as prior to 2005. Most Antique & Vintage Items will show wear & imperfections consistent with their age and use. Please look at the pictures provided. I don''t polish, but I do clean each piece for sanitary reasons. I list new items everyday see my shop at https://paigetimes.etsy.com', 'turquoise-jewelry',
