  (uuid_generate_v4(), '16-navajo-pearl-style-4mm-bead-necklace-western-pearl-style-choker-matte-silver-', '1572716352', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1572716352/16-navajo-pearl-style-4mm-bead-necklace?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALTceea322c8009373ceab7a74e568096f8eb287d31&click_sum=82f24e50&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89343-10-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1',
   '16" Navajo pearl style 4mm bead necklace, western pearl style choker, matte silver tone bead necklace', '❤️***PLEASE READ BELOW*** ❤️ *****To view all available options, the listing link below has all sizes- all lengths, all bead sizes, and color choice*****: https://www.etsy.com/listing/1642875085/11-to-30-single-strand-navajo-pearl Simple faux Navajo pearl choker- Perfect for layering!! ~Matte silver faux Navajo pearl beads ~Necklace- Approx. 16"+3" extender ~1 strand of 4mm faux matte silver Navajo pearls ~Burnished silver tone ~Nickel and lead compliant ~Light weight! FINAL SALE- please check dimensions and details before purchasing, just to ensure these will work for you! Shop polices & the fine print: :) I want you to LOVE your purchase!! If you have any questions, please just send me a message before you purchase. I hope to have included all measurements and an accurate description, but if you need more information, I’m happy to help! ~Faux western stones will typically vary with each stone. Each stone is unique with its own characteristics, distress marks, burnished marks, etc.. Your stones may be slightly different from the photograph because of these reasons. Those marks on the stones ARE supposed to be there. Metals are expected to look distressed, tarnished, burnished, and worn, depending on the piece. All sales are FINAL (hygienic purposes). Rest assured, you will receive a product that has not been worn or returned to me!! No refunds or exchanges will be given. It’s tricky to shop online. Color matching can also be difficult with the variance of different computer/phone monitors. I cannot refund or exchange for these reasons (not limited to): ~doesn’t match attire ~too big, too small, too wide, too thin ~too heavy ~too short or long ~dislike/changed mind ~buyer remorse ~If a piece arrives damaged from transit, let me know THE DAY it arrives (via USPS tracking), please! PLEASE open it when you receive it so that I can help you if there is a damage issue. This policy will be strict. Every piece will be inspected before it is shipped out to you. Much care is', 'statement-pieces',
