  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-turquoise-necklace-sterling-silver-choker', '4318835655', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4318835655/kingman-turquoise-vintage-necklace?click_key=EuBx0mClPiSdZ1De4o4rPsxL_G69%3ALTb089ccad97d578353f30acc65885b867402eee98&click_sum=7d0b3880&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-69489-9-5&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1',
   'Vintage Turquoise Necklace, Sterling Silver Choker', 'Turquoise Vintage Necklace Jewelry, Natural Navajo Turquoise Oval Gemstone, Turquoise Silver Choker Necklace Gift for Anniversary Please note : As this stone is natural, texture of every stone is different. so, the product you get in hands may slightly vary from the picture shown and not exact same as picture . And this is the beauty of each necklace being different than other. If any query, feel free and contact me. Crafted with the help of trained and experienced artisans team , our products are handmade with quality gemstones. I take care of perfect balance of combinations. We design each product taking care of style which will make you feel attractive . I also welcome to customize your choices. I try my best to serve my customers . **Thanks for Team Mohan Jewels** Production partners MohanJewels makes this item with help from Radhyshyam, West Bengal, India', 'turquoise-jewelry',
