  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-native-turquoise-silver-ring-size-11', '4614129646', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4614129646/vintage-navajo-native-turquoise-silver?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTc47cec6910a8760c9c88c73acba07f83031596bd&click_sum=511fb4c1&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-38&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTc47cec6910a8760c9c88c73acba07f83031596bd',
   'Vintage Navajo Native Turquoise Silver Ring Size 11', 'Vintage Navajo Native Turquoise Silver Ring Size 11. Not marked; tested to be at least coin (90%) silver. ---------------------------------------- All items, unless stated otherwise, are previously loved and used, showing scratches and slight imperfections (not brand new). Please refer to pictures for condition as they depict what you''ll receive. If you have any questions, ask before purchasing. Note: - Size and weight are approximate. - "Vintage" is based on look and feel; items may be older (pre-1930s) or newer (post-1980s/1990s). - We''re not experts on stones. Refer to pictures for type and quality. - "Southwestern" items reflect that style, possibly from Navajo, Zuni, Hopi, etc. - "Sterling" items are tested to be at least coin (90%) silver. No returns on international sales unless completely misrepresented.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
