  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'sterling-silver-and-blackjack-turquoise-southwestern-butterfly-ring-stunning', '4604232243', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4604232243/sterling-silver-and-blackjack-turquoise?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALTde08f9e4828fdb2383002cdbdff67f06490552fd&click_sum=6555b227&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-15&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALTde08f9e4828fdb2383002cdbdff67f06490552fd',
   'Sterling Silver and Blackjack Turquoise Southwestern Butterfly Ring Stunning', 'Sterling Silver and Blackjack Turquoise Southwestern Butterfly Ring Stunning Adjustable in Size 12.4 grams Before purchasing, please make sure your shipping address is correct in your Etsy account. I will not change the shipping address after purchase due to so much buyer fraud going around. If you purchase and need an address change, we will have to cancel the transaction and start over. Return Policy- Buyer must contact me within 5 days of delivery to notify me of return and ship with tracking insured within 7 days of receiving the item. No returns after the allotted days. Buyer pays return shipping and must return item with tracking number. Once item is returned back to me in its original condition, a refund minus original shipping will be issued. Exchanges are allowed up to 10 days from receiving item. Please check out my other items! Tons of jewelry coming up for sale. I love to combine shipping on multiple items. If there is anything wrong once the item is received and you are not happy, please contact me before leaving negative feedback so we can resolve any issues. I strive for 100% happy buyers! Please feel free to ask me questions on my items! #867485', 'turquoise-jewelry',
