  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-necklace-extenders-3mm-4mm-5mm-6mm-7mm-8mm', '1321397221', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1321397221/navajo-pearl-necklace-extenders-3mm-4mm?click_key=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%3ALT23da3ce248a9ed99d5fa793d7d3f7b6bfb757d19&click_sum=f7958da2&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-729084-8-11&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&content_source=88861da3-e3d9-479a-bf79-3455fad45126%253ALT23da3ce248a9ed99d5fa793d7d3f7b6bfb757d19',
   'Navajo Pearl Necklace Extenders, 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, 6mm, 7mm, 8mm', 'Having an extender for your pearls gives you so much more versatility! Need it a little longer in order to to have your necklace layers lay *just* right? This is for you. Our Extenders come in 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, 6mm, 7mm, and 8mm styles. Being made out of .925 sterling silver means these are made to last. We have different sizes of beads available in order for your extender to match your necklace perfectly! *6mm beaded extenders pictured* PLEASE NOTE- if you have a large, toggle style clasp please message me before purchasing to ensure it will work with these. DON''T SEE A SIZE, LENGTH, QUANTITY, OR STYLE THAT YOU''RE WANTING? Please message me and we can work together to create a custom order! NEED IT FAST? Choose the priority mail shipping upgrade at checkout!', 'statement-pieces',
