  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'hubei-turquoise-twisted-shank-ring', '4509705917', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4509705917/hubei-turquoise-twisted-shank-ring?click_key=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%3ALTe98b5aaedaffc871bbd7e3fa890f987b62f2bf9d&click_sum=4500a6db&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-37503-17-33&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=3dae72b2-8c6c-4fdc-a727-dda2bfe9b877%253ALTe98b5aaedaffc871bbd7e3fa890f987b62f2bf9d',
   'Hubei Turquoise Twisted Shank Ring', 'Product Description Make a bold yet classic statement with this handcrafted turquoise statement ring. This striking piece features a stunning turquoise cabochon from the Hubei Province in China, celebrated for its unique character and intricate patterns, making it perfect for the wearer who loves one-of-a-kind, artisan jewelry. The star of this ring is an 8.8ct natural Hubei turquoise stone. It showcases a beautiful, pale minty-aqua base shot through with a dark matrix that webs beautifully across the stone. The stone is securely nestled in a fine silver serrated bezel, which is surrounded by a sleek sterling silver shadowbox border that has been subtly oxidized to create contrast, depth, and drama. The entire setting sits on a gorgeous, substantial triple-shank sterling silver band featuring two smooth outer bands framing a central twisted rope wire accent. This multi-wire shank beautifully balances the large size of the ring face while providing an incredibly secure, comfortable fit for daily wear. ✨ Key Features Gemstone: Genuine Hubei Province turquoise cabochon Size: US Ring Size 8.25 Metals: Bezel: Fine Silver (99.9% pure silver) Ring Band & Backplate: Sterling Silver (925) Design: Large oval shadowbox setting with a triple-shank band (smooth and twisted rope wire details) Finish: Polished silver with selective oxidation to highlight the shadowbox depth Style: Southwest, Artisan, Boho, Statement, Classic Turquoise 🎁 Perfect Gift For December birthdays (Turquoise is the traditional birthstone) Collectors of unique, spiderweb or heavy-matrix natural turquoise varieties Anyone looking for a bold, substantial everyday statement ring A special milestone gift, or a timeless addition to a bohemian wardrobe 🌟 My Promise on Craftsmanship & Pricing Welcome to my journey as a newly emerging silversmith! Each piece you see here is handcrafted with passion, dedication, and a commitment to high-quality materials, including sterling and fine silver. As I continue to hone m', 'turquoise-jewelry',
