  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'reclaimed-wood-earrings-with-recycled-copper-and-turquoise-chip-inlay', '906777315', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/906777315/reclaimed-wood-earrings-with-recycled?click_key=EuslJBqaIzsPErOOexVCqDwaaz29%3ALTb977f4b0370182d711dd262874aead04d21c85ea&click_sum=7148664e&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1019172-17-4&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pop=1&sts=1',
   'Reclaimed Wood Earrings with Recycled Copper and Turquoise Chip Inlay.', 'These beautiful Modern earrings are handmade from natural pieces of reclaimed wood that have been pressed together and inlaid with Turquoise and Copper and cut into a classic teardrop shape. The wood has a lovely warmth and is extremely lightweight, perfect for sensitive ears. They are finished with hypoallergenic 14k Rose gold fish hook or lever back ear wires. The length of the earrings is around 30mm (just over 1 inch). The matching pendant for these earrings can be found here: https://www.etsy.com/listing/906790467/turquoise-copper-inlaid-wood-pendant Each pair of earrings is handmade by Josiah Eidmann in Wisconsin and is his original design, USA.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
