   'Turquoise Pocket Watch Necklace in Bronze, Black or Silver, Choose Your Length', 'A fully working pocket watch with a domed turquoise cabochon in the centre is suspended on a long antiqued bronze chain. The necklace is antiqued brass with a lobster clasp. The watch is 1 1/2 inches (38 mm) in diameter, and pops open when you press the button at the top. (there''s protective film to remove when you receive it). A battery is already in the watch. The cabochon is a manufactured faux turquoise stone. Choose your chain length from the drop down menu or ask me for something different. Also now available in shiny silver plate or plack plated. This necklace comes in an organza gift bag. TO MY LOVELY USA AND EU CUSTOMERS! All duties and tariffs will be paid by me in advance when your order is shipped. There will be no duties and tariffs for you to pay on delivery. The cost of the duties and tariffs is included in the postage price. Manufacturer(s): EU responsible person: Linda Eaton Princesa Guayarmina 8, Casa 27 Puerto del Carmen 35510, Las Palmas, Spain. mellotron-scratch [!at] hotmail.co.uk Product safety: This item is not suitable for children under 12 years of age.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
